# Copy to `.env` for local dev (gitignored). Server-side only — never exposed to the client.
# The AI intake feature (api/extract.ts) calls the Anthropic API with this key.
#
# Where to set it:
#   - Local:  put it in `.env` and run the API with `vercel dev` (plain `vite` does not run /api).
#   - Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables → add for Production + Preview.
#
# Without it, /api/extract returns `not_configured` and the rest of the app still works.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
